## Rows skipped
zh-hans-a #8 (003 Q16–Q20 and the close, and the same blanks in 005, 006, 008, 009). The lines are body text split by U+200B, and 005 has empty bold lines `**​**`. Promoting them to `##` headings changes heading levels. Deleting U+200B changes the ZWSP count. checkHeadings and checkBlocks require both to match the Korean source, which has the same blanks. Block count and ZWSP count were left unchanged. Q16's wording was already the question.

zh-hans-b #10 (013 and 015 U+200B). Same checker constraint. "记载地区即可（例：台北市）。" and the blank-only lines were not deleted. Sentences in those blocks were not otherwise flagged.

zh-hans-b #23 (万/亿 grouping of exact amounts in 010, 011, 017, 018). Tried, then reverted. The checker multiplies only 만/萬 and 억/億, not Simplified 万/亿, so "2500万元" was read as 2500 and "1亿元" dropped 100,000,000 (017 and 018 numbers FAIL; 010 and 011 failed the same way). "157万9589元" would also be the wrong amount: 157万 is 1,570,000 and 9589 is a second number, not 1,579,589. Comma form kept: 1,579,589; 1,570,000; 1,000,000; the 011 fine ranges; 25,000,000; 10,000,000; 30,000,000; 100,000,000. 0 instances changed.

