## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
zh-hans-b #23, the form "157万9589元" for 新台币1,579,589元. That is not one amount. 157万 is 1,570,000, and 9589 is left over. The comma form is the judgment figure. The same row's round amounts (157万, 4万, 2500万, 1亿, and the rest) are natural mainland grouping, but this checker's magnitude step only multiplies 萬/億, so those strings failed numbers and were reverted.

"各股东1人1票" in the same 018 sentence. The suggested rewrite does not replace it. "一人一票" would drop a counted 1. The phrase already says one shareholder, one vote, and was left.

Nothing else in the two reviews was rejected as wrong. The U+200B rows and the paragraph-merge suggestions (013 bank employee, 015 guidelines) were adapted inside the existing blocks because the checker pins ZWSP count, heading levels, and block count to the Korean source.
